  "summary": "数字字符串的每个前缀若能被 m 整除则对应位置记一，否则记零，返回全部标记。",
  "insight": "无需构造可能溢出的前缀整数。若旧余数为 r，追加数字 d 后的新余数就是 (10r+d) mod m；滚动维护余数即可。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "前缀可能远超整数范围",
    "余数乘十应使用 long",
    "答案位置 i 对应包含 word[i] 的前缀"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "rolling-prefix-remainder",
      "title": "滚动维护前缀余数",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "逐位利用十进制余数递推。",
      "steps": [
        "remainder=0",
        "从左到右读取 digit",
        "remainder=(remainder*10+digit)%m",
        "若 remainder 为零则 answer[i]=1",
        "返回标记数组"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1) excluding output"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/rolling-prefix-remainder/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/rolling-prefix-remainder/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/rolling-prefix-remainder/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
